LICENSE — DSSIM ImageJ Plugin

This plugin is derived from the SSIM Index ImageJ plugin by:

  Gabriel Prieto, Margarita Chevalier, Eduardo Guibelalde
  Department of Radiology, Faculty of Medicine
  Universidad Complutense, Madrid, Spain
  gprietor@med.ucm.es

which itself implements the algorithm of:

  Zhou Wang, A. C. Bovik, H. R. Sheikh, E. P. Simoncelli,
  "Image quality assessment: From error visibility to structural similarity",
  IEEE Trans. Image Processing, vol. 13, pp. 600-612, Apr. 2004.

